    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The [`extent`](arworldmap/extent.md) and [`center`](arworldmap/center.md) properties together define a bounding box for the data recorded in the reference object in its local coordinate system.",
      "ko": "This property returns `nil` if you’re not encoding.",
      "sourceHash": "cea394c9756b28e37f2abeb39e1e79a2ba456f96d56c15b58dfe65e06fe4e9f3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "You define that coordinate system with the transform parameter when calling `extractReferenceObject(transform:center:extent:)`, and can modify it by creating another reference object with [`applyingTransform(_:)`](arreferenceobject/applyingtransform(_:).md).",
      "ko": "`extractReferenceObject(transform:center:extent:)`를 호출할 때 transform 매개변수로 해당 좌표계를 정의하고, [`applyingTransform(_:)`](arreferenceobject/applyingtransform(_:).md)로 다른 참조 객체를 생성하여 수정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1fb345f37ca44dad5b378d9c4674b18c7e2f9c5c199365c54a5c83a2c18e5810",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
